---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Kristy Wong - VFX Artist">
	<main class="pt-24 pb-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-12 md:flex-row">
				<!-- Profile Image -->
				<div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
					<div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
						<div
							class="absolute inset-0 bg-purple-900/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent"
						>
						</div>
						<!-- Placeholder for profile image -->
						<div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-gray-800">
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								class="h-24 w-24 text-gray-600"
								fill="none"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								stroke="currentColor"
							>
								<path
									stroke-linecap="round"
									stroke-linejoin="round"
									stroke-width="1"
									d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-8 rounded-xl bg-gray-800/50 p-6">
						<h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-purple-400">Skills</h3>
						<div class="space-y-4">
							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-300">3D Animation</span>
									<span class="text-gray-400">95%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-700">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600" style="width: 95%"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-300">Visual Effects</span>
									<span class="text-gray-400">90%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-700">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600" style="width: 90%"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-300">Compositing</span>
									<span class="text-gray-400">85%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-700">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600" style="width: 85%"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-300">Motion Graphics</span>
									<span class="text-gray-400">80%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-700">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600" style="width: 80%"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-300">Rigging</span>
									<span class="text-gray-400">75%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-700">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600" style="width: 75%"></div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- About Content -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-3">
					<div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
						<h2>My Story</h2>
						<p>
							Hi, I'm Kristy Wong, a passionate VFX artist with expertise in creating stunning
							visual effects and animations. With over [X] years of experience in the industry, I've
							had the privilege of working on a variety of exciting projects across film,
							television, and digital media.
						</p>

						<p>
							My journey began with a fascination for blending art and technology to create
							immersive visual experiences. I graduated from [Your University/School] with a degree
							in [Your Degree], which provided me with a strong foundation in both technical skills
							and creative storytelling.
						</p>

						<h2 class="mt-8">Experience</h2>
						<p>
							Throughout my career, I've collaborated with talented teams on projects ranging from
							blockbuster films to innovative digital campaigns. My expertise includes [list your
							specific expertise areas like particle simulations, fluid dynamics, character
							animation, etc.].
						</p>

						<p>
							I've worked with leading studios such as [Studio Name] and [Studio Name], contributing
							to projects like [Project Name] and [Project Name]. These experiences have honed my
							ability to deliver high-quality visual effects that enhance storytelling and create
							memorable viewer experiences.
						</p>

						<h2 class="mt-8">My Approach</h2>
						<p>
							I believe that great visual effects should seamlessly integrate with the narrative,
							enhancing the story without overpowering it. My approach combines technical precision
							with artistic vision, always striving to push the boundaries of what's possible while
							maintaining a focus on the emotional impact of the work.
						</p>

						<p>
							When I'm not creating visual effects, I enjoy [mention hobbies or interests that might
							be relevant], which continuously inspire my creative process and bring fresh
							perspectives to my work.
						</p>

						<div class="mt-8">
							<h2>Software & Tools</h2>
							<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Maya</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Houdini</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Nuke</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">After Effects</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Cinema 4D</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">ZBrush</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Substance Designer</span>
								<span class="rounded-full bg-gray-700 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Unreal Engine</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-12">
						<a
							href="/contact"
							class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-purple-600 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-purple-700"
						>
							Get In Touch
						</a>
						<a
							href="/portfolio"
							class="ml-4 inline-block rounded-lg border border-purple-500 bg-transparent px-6 py-3 font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-purple-900/30"
						>
							View My Work
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
